		(property "Footprint Note" "KiCad has no USB4970 footprint. GCT's USB4970 drawing specifies the same recommended layout as the USB4125: pad centres 1.00/3.04/5.50 mm, widths 0.70/0.76/0.80 mm x 1.20 mm, shell holes 8.64 x 3.80 mm apart, 1.10 x 1.70 mm with 0.60 x 1.20 mm slots. Verified against the drawing 2026-08-28. USB4970-00-A takes the 1.00 mm shell stake, so the plain USB4125-xx-x footprint is the match; -0190 is the 1.90 mm stake variant."
